{"id":"52e873e199432996","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski.md","title":"Löwenheim-Skolem-Tarski Theorem","display":"thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski — Löwenheim-Skolem-Tarski Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski","aliases":["17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski"],"display":"thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski — Löwenheim-Skolem-Tarski Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"source_section":"2.1","source_result":"Corollary 2.1.6","source_pages_print":[67,68],"source_pages_djvu":[83,84],"source_verification":"statement-and-proof-compared","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-1.3.3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski — Löwenheim-Skolem-Tarski Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Corollary 2.1.6"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67</span><span>68</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>83</span><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-and-proof-compared"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-1.3.3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>语言符号集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> 与语言基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a> 的接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal parameter)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A_0\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\\aleph_0\\leq\\bigl||\\mathfrak A_0|\\bigr|\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\max\\{|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|=\\kappa\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A_0\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\\aleph_0\\leq\\bigl||\\mathfrak A_0|\\bigr|\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\max\\{|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|=\\kappa\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mere satisfiability is insufficient: a theory may have only finite models. The premise therefore requires an infinite model.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-lang